WEBVTT

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:03.020
Don't Hurt Me,

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:03.020
Don't Hurt Me,

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:03.020
My Healer!

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:04.400
Behold, the vast world in which we live!

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:09.770
It is rampant with monsters 
that threaten human life.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:16.310
This threat is opposed by 
countless adventurers! Heroes!

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:21.430
Every day, they face these 
dangerous battles...

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.590
To protect the people! To protect the world!

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.360
And I, Alvin, am one of them!

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.020
Wow, an encounter already!

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.770
All right!

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:37.920
Here we go!

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:40.930
<b>This episode's title is</b>

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:56.700
<b>In this world where monsters are rampant...</b>

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:43.640
Kuma!

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.100
Curse you...

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:53.070
Stronger than I expected, 
given those cute button eyes...

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:53.740
<b>Alvin (Male Lead/Armored Warrior) Is Trying to Make It as an Adventurer in a Land Ravaged by Monsters and Other Such Baddies When He Ends up Getting the Bad End of a Fight With a Bear-Like Creature Only to Be Saved by the Dark Elf Healer Girl Carla (Female Lead/Dark Elf) Who Happens to Be Passing By Except Her Personality Being What It Is Things Turn Into an Argument Which Confuses the Bear Creature Even More and Then Something Not in the Original Manga Happens Where They Get Taken Back to the Bear's House and Some of the Manga Fans Are Like “Huh?” but See This Is Based on a Manga That Was Published Online Before the Comic Was Serialized Called “What Story Is This?” That Was Set In the Same World So the Anime Staff and Manga Creators Asked to Use This Space to Explain What's Going On Also There's No Codes or Hidden Messages in This Just So You Know and That's the Deal With Episode 1</b>

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.460
Kuma!

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.480
No!

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:13.850
This is... not good!

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:15.860
Excuse me...

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.380
Are you having trouble?

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.280
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:24.680
I'm a healer. 
My name is Carla, the dark elf.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.200
The pleasure is all mine!

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:29.370
I'm Alvin, the human...

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:31.630
I'm working as a warrior...

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.680
But this is no time for niceties!

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.570
Are you all right?

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:38.970
Does it look like I'm all right?!

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:40.820
Quit standing there and help me already!

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:46.620
If you want to ask for someone's help,

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:50.830
shouldn't you kneel down in front of them 
and press your forehead to the ground?!

00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:57.280
A moment, if you please?

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:58.340
Gao.

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.730
Oh? Is something the matter?

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.340
That was supposed to be the 
part where you help me.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:06.220
Why the hell are you asking me to grovel?!

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.840
Why are you yelling at me all of a sudden?

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:12.100
Are you overly stressed, perhaps?

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:14.840
I'm only stressed because of this situation!

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:16.650
You're angry that the magibeast 
was about to beat you,

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:18.640
so you're taking it out on me?

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:20.740
You should really take responsibility 
for your own failings...

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.560
Would you shut up?!

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:24.100
You yelled at me again!

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.560
Humans are scary! I hate you!

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:29.440
H-Hang on! 
It's really not worth crying over!

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:32.540
I'm sorry for yelling, okay?!

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:35.630
Sorry?

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:38.590
Not painfully remorseful?

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:39.540
You little...

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:43.620
<i>No, stop it. 
Don't let her take control.</i>

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:46.650
<i>Just engage her calmly, 
like a mature adult...</i>

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.150
Stare...

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:55.790
Well? Where's that "painfully remorseful"?

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:58.570
<i>I can't do it... I'm gonna blow!</i>

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:00.060
Gao?

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.220
Oh, crap! I totally forgot!

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:04.570
H-Hang on a little longer, would you?

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:08.130
All right, here's what we'll do.

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:09.430
Carla, was it?

00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:13.070
If you help me, I'll do one thing you ask!

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:14.180
<i>Anything</i> you ask?!

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:16.060
Within reason, of course!

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.080
Grovel, then!

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.710
Is that your kink or something?!

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:20.610
Actually, forget about that.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.560
Instead, Alvin-san...

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.830
I'd like you to form a party with me!

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.700
Party?

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:31.490
The truth is, I've never 
been in a party before.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:33.490
Understandable, given the 
whole personality thing.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:37.300
No one will actually talk to me.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:41.200
I guess they all think 
I'm out of their league.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.170
More like leagues beneath a noxious swamp...

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:44.980
And that's the worst wink I've ever seen.

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.500
Anyway, I guess that's fine.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:51.540
Th-Thank you, Alvin-san!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.500
<i>I can just ditch her later, after all.</i>

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:57.730
Just so you know, 
my adventurer rank isn't very high.

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.120
So don't get your hopes up!

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:01.890
Don't worry! 
My hopes were low from the start!

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:04.130
That's not the part where you agree!

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.390
And knock off the thumbs up!

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:08.500
Anyway, could you make with the healing?

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:09.500
Of the nation?

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.730
No, of me!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:11.960
Of you?

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:15.110
But you seemed in pretty good shape with 
all the yapping you've been doing...

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:16.160
Phrasing, please!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.350
Oh, I know.

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:20.230
I think someone wants to be coddled!

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:21.530
Could just you get to it?

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:24.370
I was just trying to lighten the mood.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:27.150
Well, please don't. You stink at it.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.280
All right. Here I go!

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:33.510
This is so annoying.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:36.120
<i>I'm ditching her the minute the battle—</i>

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:37.170
Hold still!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.300
Your heart is still moving.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.080
I'd be dead if it wasn't!

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.550
Don't shout at me like that!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.470
You made me curse you accidentally!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.840
You're the one who—

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:53.980
Wait, what did you say?

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.490
I placed a curse on you accidentally.

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:57.300
Tee-hee!

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:00.500
A healer who curses people is a little 
avant-garde, don't you think?!

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:01.990
Please remain calm.

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:04.000
It's not much of a curse, really.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.750
R-Really?

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:09.250
It'll just kill you if 
we get 300 meters apart.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:11.730
K-Kill me...

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:19.660
G-Gosh... I know you're grateful, 
but you don't have to grovel.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:20.990
It's a little off-putting, really.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:24.010
I'm not grateful, I'm despondent!

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.250
What am I supposed to do?!

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.720
I can't ditch you like this!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.840
Th-That's awful!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.320
You were just having your fun with me?!

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:34.000
I assure you, <i>none</i> of this is fun for me!

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:35.510
Would you two please calm down, gao?

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:36.650
Who's that?

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:38.640
It's not good to fight, kuma.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.080
Alvin-san.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:43.280
It's really not nice to yell 
at a young lady, bear.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:47.080
And, Carla-chan, you could be a bit 
more considerate of his feelings, gao.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.530
It's important for a 
party to be civil, kuma.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:52.850
Let's talk it out, bear.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:54.030
Okay, gao?

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.140
Where'd this articulate 
commentary come from?!

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:57.790
And get your speech tic consistent already!

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:04.300
Ahem!

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:06.780
This cycle of abuse won't get us anywhere.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.200
I'm willing to open a dialogue.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:09.150
The topic is...

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:12.670
The tendency of warriors 
to look down on healers!

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.290
Sorry to interrupt already,

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:16.060
but I have objections regarding this topic.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.260
And I'm curious about one other thing...

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.530
Does the accused have a statement?

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:22.440
Well, now I have another objection...

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.270
But setting that aside for now...

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:27.730
Why is the magibeast a part of this?

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:29.790
Oh, how reprehensible!

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:31.630
Just because you're a magibeast,

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:34.090
he doesn't want to give you 
a voice in the conversation!

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:37.040
It's more the fact that we 
were fighting a minute ago!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.700
Truly reprehensible!

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:41.630
Magibeasts are living things, just as we are!

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:45.730
Different though our forms may be, if only 
we would join hands in the spirit of kinship,

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:47.040
we could surely achieve understanding!

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:52.190
Seems a little late to pull 
out the "holy woman" act!

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.060
May I, kuma?

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.430
He has a proposal?

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:59.900
I'm told that the longest-lived magibeasts

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:03.380
have high intelligence and 
a wealth of experience.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:06.430
Well, maybe if we're talking 
about dragons and stuff...

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:10.560
Before you give your opinion, 
could we have your name?

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:13.070
Oh, forgive my rudeness, gao.

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:19.870
Hmm... Our species doesn't have what your 
kind refer to as "names," kuma...

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:23.340
Despite the high intelligence, he still 
can't keep the speech tic consistent.

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:29.100
But your kind tends to call our 
species the "Mostly Bear," bear.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.930
That's pretty darn lazy!

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:33.720
What were you going to say, Mostly-san?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.890
Oh, yes, kuma.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:38.950
It occurred to me when I was watching 
your conversation earlier...

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:40.230
First, Carla-chan.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:45.070
Your healer class is a very 
vulnerable one, kuma.

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:49.040
The purpose of the warrior 
class is to protect you.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:53.650
So if he dies, that would 
put you in danger, as well.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.740
You seem like a very intelligent person,

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:59.310
so I'm sure you know what that 
indicates for your behavior, right?

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:03.110
And Alvin-san, the accused.

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:04.380
"Accused"...

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.910
Even if you were engaged in combat,

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:09.060
you used extremely abusive language 
towards someone you'd just met.

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:10.900
The way you spoke seemed to suggest,

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:15.210
"all healers are expected to heal all warriors, 
even ones they've just met,"

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:17.700
which is a very arrogant attitude, kuma.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.930
Elves are very sensitive 
to negative emotions, gao.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:25.890
It's very possible she picked 
up on that hostility, bear.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:30.090
I'm sorry to subject you to 
this awful lecture, gao.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:34.700
But if you're going to be a party, 
that means you'll need each other!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.180
And it appears, Alvin-san, 
that you'll have to remain

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:40.590
within 300 meters of Carla-chan 
for the foreseeable future.

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:45.540
I think it's important to approach each day 
with a spirit of respect and gratitude, kuma!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:48.950
A-A truly great speech, as expected of a 
magibeast that can speak the human tongue.

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:53.300
His long lifespan has afforded 
him great wisdom indeed!

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:54.670
Hey!

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:58.910
Were you sleeping through 
that whole nice speech?!

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.700
Of course I wasn't!

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:01.950
You were so!

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:05.940
Don't tell me... you've never 
heard of "sleep learning"?

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:07.470
So you <i>were</i> sleeping!

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:08.750
Sit down right now!

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:09.560
But why—

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:11.090
Just sit down!

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.340
Fine...

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:14.930
What exactly is your problem?

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:17.360
It's like you don't even 
care that you cursed me!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.250
Calm down, kuma!

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:23.110
No way! There are some kinds of people 
where you need to take a firm hand!

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.300
Now, now, gao...

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:28.500
And what kind of thoughtless jerk falls 
asleep when someone's talking to them?!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.650
Now, now, kuma...

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:33.200
That's only allowed when 
it's the school principal!

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:35.760
Now, now! That's not good either, bear!

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.490
What about your local representative?!

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:40.790
Napping in front of government 
officials is strictly forbidden!

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:44.230
Napping in front of your principal 
should be strictly forbidden, too, kuma!

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:46.340
And what are you even talking about, bear?

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:49.750
This magibeast has lived a 
very long time, you know!

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:50.590
Er...

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:52.120
Which means he's your elder!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:55.110
